sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Simulateur
  participant I as ingestion-service
  participant K as Kafka
  participant U as usage-service
  participant X as InfluxDB
  participant D as device-service
  participant Us as user-service
  participant A as alert-service
  participant M as Mailpit
  S->>I: POST /api/v1/ingestion {deviceId, energyConsumed, timestamp}
  I->>K: topic energy-usage
  I-->>S: 201 Created
  K->>U: energy-usage (groupe usage-service)
  U->>X: point energy_usage
  loop toutes les 10 secondes
    U->>X: somme de la dernière heure par appareil
    U->>D: GET /api/v1/device/{id} (propriétaire)
    U->>Us: GET /api/v1/user/{id} (seuil, e-mail, alerting)
    alt total > seuil
      U->>K: topic energy-alerts {userId, threshold, energyConsumed, email}
      K->>A: energy-alerts (groupe alert-service)
      A->>M: e-mail « Energy Usage Alert for User … »
    end
  end
